OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry and rather cloudy
OL,6,Fday, but a few bright or sunny spells
OL,7,Fbreaking through at times. The odd
OL,8,Flight showers along the west coast.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.
OL,11,FThen the rest of the night will be dry
OL,12,Fwith cloud clearing to allow some
OL,13,Flengthy clear periods. Chilly in some
OL,14,Frural glens.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FA cloudy start in parts of the
OL,17,Feast, otherwise it will be dry day
OL,18,Fwith some warm sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
